{
  "$schema": "../../../schema/jwsim-test-1.json",
  "$comment": "Tres arranques. (1) Cable conectado y sin servidor DHCP: Not started, Link OFF mientras el PHY negocia (el runtime reintenta cada 5 s), DHCP pending con busy=1, DHCP failed tras el timeout de 5 s y nuevo intento. (2) El servidor DHCP guionado responde OFFER y ACK (xid 0x394, el que genera el firmware con la semilla por defecto; MAC 02:4A:57:C4:0A:24) con 192.168.250.10/24, puerta de enlace y DNS 192.168.250.1. El runtime queda listo e imprime la IP. (3) Sin W5500 (--no-eth): 'No Ethernet hardware' con diag=HW.",
  "sketch": "package:libraries/JWPLC_Ethernet/examples/01.Ethernet_DHCP_Basic",
  "runs": [
    {
      "until_ms": 18000,
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          "^JWPLC Basic - Ethernet DHCP$",
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=0 diag=INI status=Not started$",
            "count": 1,
            "before_ms": 2000
          },
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=0 diag=LNK status=Link OFF$",
            "min": 1,
            "before_ms": 6500
          },
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=1 diag=DHC status=DHCP pending$",
            "min": 3,
            "after_ms": 6500,
            "before_ms": 12000
          },
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=0 diag=DHC status=DHCP failed$",
            "min": 3,
            "after_ms": 12000,
            "before_ms": 17000
          },
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=1 diag=DHC status=DHCP pending$",
            "min": 1,
            "after_ms": 17000
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "ready=1",
          " ip="
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "until_ms": 10000,
      "stim": [
        "6300 net 0 udp 192.168.250.1:67 ",
        "7400 net 0 udp 192.168.250.1:67 "
      ],
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=1 diag=DHC status=DHCP pending$",
            "min": 1,
            "before_ms": 9000
          },
          {
            "match": "^ready=1 busy=0 diag=--- status=OK ip=192\\.168\\.250\\.10$",
            "min": 1,
            "after_ms": 8000
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "DHCP failed"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "until_ms": 4000,
      "args": [
        "--no-eth"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          {
            "match": "^ready=0 busy=0 diag=HW status=No Ethernet hardware$",
            "min": 2
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "ready=1",
          "Link OFF"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
